================================================================================
=  VIMTUTOR ADVANCED  --  Lesson 13: Cheat Sheet (one page)                   =
================================================================================

  WINDOWS AND SPLITS                                     (Lesson 1)
  ~ :split :vsplit :new :vnew     Ctrl-W h j k l w p H J K L r x T
  ~ Ctrl-W c q o + - = _ | < >    :resize N :vertical resize N

  BUFFERS AND TABS                                       (Lesson 2)
  ~ :ls :b name<C-t> :bn :bp :b#  Ctrl-6 :bd [!] :ball :vertical ball
  ~ :bufdo :windo :tabnew gt gT Ngt :tabs :tabclose :tabonly :tabmove

  REGISTERS                                              (Lesson 3)
  ~ "ayyw "Aappend "_blackhole "+clipboard "0p (last yank) :reg :put a

  MACROS                                                 (Lesson 4)
  ~ q{reg} ... q    @a  @@  5@a    :'<,'>normal @a    :put a :let @a=".."

  VISUAL AND TEXT OBJECTS                                (Lesson 5)
  ~ v V Ctrl-V gv o O I A c ~     iw aw i( i{ i" ip it  2i)
  ~ :sort :'<,'>s/old/new/g       surround: cs ds ysiw S"

  SEARCH, REPLACE, QUICKFIX                              (Lesson 6)
  ~ * # n N :noh                  :%s/old/new/g  gi gc  :&&
  ~ \v (very magic)  \zs \ze      :g/pat/cmd  :v/inv-pat/d
  ~ :vimgrep /pat/j **/* :copen   :cn :cp :cc N  :cfdo %s/././g | update
  ~ q: q/  Ctrl-R Ctrl-W  Ctrl-R / :%s/pat//gn (count only)

  MARKS AND JUMPS                                        (Lesson 7)
  ~ ma mA 'a `a :marks :delm      Ctrl-O Ctrl-I :jumps
  ~ '' `` `. `^                   % ]m [m [[ ]] ]# gd gD   q: q/

  FOLDS                                                  (Lesson 8)
  ~ :set foldmethod=indent        zf zfap zF zd zE (manual)
  ~ zo zc za zO zC zA             zR zM zj zk [z ]z foldcolumn

  CONFIG, PLUGINS, THEMES                                (Lesson 9)
  ~ :e $MYVIMRC :source $MYVIMRC  :options :echo stdpath('data')
  ~ nnoremap <leader>x ...        let mapleader = " "
  ~ :PlugStatus :PlugInstall :PlugUpdate :PlugClean
  ~ :CocInstall coc-tsserver      :DotTheme codedark  :colorscheme <Tab>

  FILES, :args, SESSIONS, netrw                          (Lesson 10)
  ~ :Ex :Sexplore :Vexplore :Texplore   v o t i - D R (in netrw)
  ~ :set path+=** :find gf Ctrl-W gF    :args :argdo ... | update
  ~ :mksession ~/s.vim  vim -S ~/s.vim  :mkview :loadview :lcd :e!

  TERMINAL AND GIT                                       (Lesson 11)
  ~ :!cmd :r !cmd :%!cmd :sh Ctrl-Z fg
  ~ :term i Ctrl-\ Ctrl-N :bd     :G (- s cc <Enter> D)  :Git blame
  ~ :Gvdiffsplit ]c [c dp do      :vertical diffsplit file

  COMPLETION AND LSP (coc.nvim)                          (Lesson 12)
  ~ Ctrl-Space Tab S-Tab Enter Ctrl-N Ctrl-P
  ~ K  gd  gr  gy  gi  Ctrl-O     ]d [d :CocList diagnostics
  ~ <Leader>rn <Leader>ac <Leader>qf    :CocList outline :CocCommand
  ~ :CocConfig :CocInfo :CocRestart :CocInstall :CocList extensions

  WHERE THINGS LIVE
  ~ ~/.vimrc / ~/.config/nvim/init.vim    your init file (one source line)
  ~ ~/.local/share/vimtutor/              this tutor: lessons + shared config
  ~ config/vimrc.common                   the actual shared configuration
  ~ plugged/                              vim-plug clones
  ~ stdpath('data')/coc/extensions        coc extensions

  Back to the TOC:  :Tutor      Next lesson:  :Tutor 0  for the index.

================================================================================
